- Ya ampun!

32
00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:24.603
- Jangan sentuh dia!
- Lepaskan!

33
00:02:24.687 --> 00:02:25.771
- Biarkan dia pergi!
- Bergerak!

34
00:02:25.855 --> 00:02:26.897
- Doktor!
- Biarkan dia pergi!

35
00:02:26.981 --> 00:02:28.691
Tolong jangan pergi, Doktor!

36
00:02:28.774 --> 00:02:31.277
- Tolong, saya merayu awak.
- Sial, itu menyakitkan.

37
00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:34.572
Doktor, tolong.

38
00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:38.742
Hei, ada Pengerusi Ju
