apa? Tidak, bukan Filipina!
Saya benci Filipina!

59
00:04:05.704 --> 00:04:08.415
Tidak, saya mengalami trauma daripadanya!
Tidak, bukan Filipina!

60
00:04:08.499 --> 00:04:11.752
Kemudian, bagaimana dengan Boracay?

61
00:04:11.835 --> 00:04:13.337
Boracay bunyinya bagus!

62
00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.922
Boracay? Boracay!

63
00:04:15.381 --> 00:04:16.298
Saya suka Boracay.

64
00:04:17.383 --> 00:04:21.011
Kita tidak perlu memberitahunya bahawa Boracay
adalah sebahagian daripada Filipina, bukan?

65
00:04:21.095 --> 00:04:22.012
Sudah tentu tidak.

66
00:04:22.513 --> 00:04:23.806
DEPOSIT DITERIMA DARIPADA LEE SEON-MI

67
00:04:26.225 --> 00:04:27.184
Ia di sini!

68
00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:28.268
bagus!

69
00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:34.608
Betul ke saya baca ni?

70
00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:37.361
